{"hw":"δεινόω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">δεινόω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">δειν-όω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">make terrible: exaggerate,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἐπὶ τὸ μεῖζον πάντα δεινώσας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.74</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δεινῶσαι τὰς συμφοράς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Per.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">28</span> </span>.</div></div>"}